# Patch "schema-increw": REMOVED from the upstream schema before reasoning/import (upstream files are never edited).
# op:inCrew is declared owl:inverseOf op:hasCrewMember but carries the SAME domain/range (PirateCrew -> Character) as hasCrewMember,
# contradicting both the inverse axiom and its own comment ("The crew to which this pirate belongs"); the data uses
# <character> op:inCrew <crew>.  Left alone, OWL RL types every character as a PirateCrew and every crew as a Character.
@prefix op:   <http://kalnassag.com/onepiece#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
op:inCrew rdfs:domain op:PirateCrew ; rdfs:range op:Character .
